{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Island Deck&quot; is a turn-based strategy game combined with island construction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are sent by the king to a small island in the south to develop, build, and collect resources to enrich the kingdom's treasury.<br>Build your island with the cards in your hand, gather resources, and complete various tasks assigned by the king.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your island with a variety of cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allocate and manage your island's resources to expand your territory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill your duties as a lord and complete the king's missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive by defending against natural disasters and enemy invasions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Draw cards from pack to build your island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950090/extras/d15d5923b65739f370a149516e9bc4ec.avif?t=1756887849\" width=1322 height=832 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950090/extras/3b027f606a1e938e7a00db32fee2f3ea.avif?t=1756887849\" width=1571 height=506 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Assign villagers to work, harvest, and manage your island's resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950090/extras/1893ba0adb15a7bded6e5a2801752950.avif?t=1756887849\" width=905 height=425 /></span></p>